{
  "wave": "MODEL",
  "note": "Real screens of the reference instance (guide/reference, http://localhost:8480) for the 'Model your data' pages. Light theme, 1440 px wide, taken by guide/tools/screens.mjs (--file MODEL.screens.json) into guide/public/screens/<name>.png; names start with model-. Dialogs are cancelled; nothing is installed, activated, published or moved. State needed (see MODEL.data-changes.md): the model draft 'Guide draft' (a draft of guide-reference-swiss 1.0.0, id f9c3765e-85b1-409c-8e06-10b48fc8677b, created through New draft; recreate it and put its id in the editor URLs to retake); the mapping 'Guide mapping' (Graubünden to Default, created through New copy or move, key guide-mapping). Run order matters for the draft: model-field-dialog and model-relation-dialog save their step in 'after' (so run them once on a fresh draft), model-field-added, model-relation-added, model-history and model-compare need those steps; model-issues-error and model-draft-json-error need the deliberate error (a column 'ghost-field' added to the view 'municipalities' of Network through the draft page's JSON, Save draft), model-issues-none needs it removed again. The 'Dry run' tab of the Issues panel only exists on a draft with a workbook, so it has no screen here.",
